				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9fb19223-41f5-59bd-b5dd-e729fd009ae8")
	)
	(text "Left channel only. Right input grounded; right gain code=0 (mute).\nREF and AV levels stored independently by MCU.\nFirmware must prohibit all positive gain codes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b948850e-d8c5-5ffd-97a5-8aef023ad217")
	)
	(text "GAIN TUNE: R38=20k normal (input design ceiling 4Vrms).\nR38=10k gives +6dB; use only with <=2Vrms sources and recalibrate both modes."
